.SH "NAME"
WebService::ILS::RecordedBooks::Partner \- RecordedBooks partner API
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 1
\&    use WebService::ILS::RecordedBooks::Partner;
.Ve
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
WebService::ILS::RecordedBooks::Partner \- services
that use trusted partner credentials
.PP
See WebService::ILS::RecordedBooks
.SH "DISCOVERY METHODS"
.IX Header "DISCOVERY METHODS"
.SS "facet_search ($facets)"
