.SH "NATIVE METHODS"
.IX Header "NATIVE METHODS"
.ie n .SS "native_quick_search ($query, $category)"
.el .SS "native_quick_search ($query, \f(CW$category\fP)"
.IX Subsection "native_quick_search ($query, $category)"
.Vb 2
\&  $category can be one of \*(Aqall\*(Aq, \*(Aqtitle\*(Aq, \*(Aqauthor\*(Aq, or  \*(Aqnarrator\*(Aq;
\&    optional, defaults to \*(Aqall\*(Aq
.Ve
.SS "native_facet_search ($facets)"
.IX Subsection "native_facet_search ($facets)"
.Vb 4
\&  $facets can be either:
\&  * a hashref of facet => [values],
\&  * an arrayref of values
\&  * a single value
.Ve
.ie n .SS "native_named_query_search ($query, $media)"
.el .SS "native_named_query_search ($query, \f(CW$media\fP)"
.IX Subsection "native_named_query_search ($query, $media)"
.Vb 2
\&  $query can be one of \*(Aqbestsellers\*(Aq, \*(Aqmost\-popular\*(Aq, \*(Aqnewly\-added\*(Aq
\&  $media can be \*(Aqeaudio\*(Aq or \*(Aqebook\*(Aq
.Ve
